+DM_HOME_QUIT	player	`0` turns off quitting with the controller's Home button (Mac and iOS, on by default): held for 2 s it opens a quit prompt over the game, A quits as ⌘Q does (on iOS the app closes after the cloud saves went out, as Quit in the in-game menu does), B or Home closes it (`home_quit.h`, `quit_prompt.h`)
